\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362769\",\"time\":\"2025-12-04T20:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31101\",\"name\":\"The Polar Express\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-polar-express\",\"posterImage\":\"vbixdlva1noq2eqrdzzcflz7uks0\",\"bannerImage\":\"qmh3rm6eej0sckb5ift7hwp1yvg2\",\"synopsis\":\"Late on Christmas Eve, a boy sits in bed doubting the existence of Santa Claus and waiting to hear the sound of sleigh bells.\\nInstead, a magical steam engine roars outside his window and he begins an extraordinary journey towards the North Pole and beyond his imagination\",\"starring\":\"Tom Hanks, Leslie Zemeckis, Eddie Deezen\",\"directedBy\":\"Robert Zemeckis\",\"producedBy\":\"Robert Zemeckis, William Teitler, Steve Starkey, Gary Goetzman\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":100,\"genre\":\"Animation\",\"allGenres\":\"Animation, Family, Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy\",\"rating\":\"U\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"TQhRqtt-Fpo\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2004-11-10\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-11-29\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":9.4811,\"tmdbId\":\"5255\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"14214\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Polar Express (2D) [U]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362874\",\"time\":\"2025-11-29T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser kids-club christmas\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362875\",\"time\":\"2025-11-30T11:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser kids-club christmas\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31088\",\"name\":\"Love Actually\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"love-actually\",\"posterImage\":\"rfh4r91gzogp742fad5z2a9kqsyk\",\"bannerImage\":\"yomoqwpkqt666y902n230wagowhh\",\"synopsis\":\"Eight London couples try to deal with their relationships in different ways. Their tryst with love makes them discover how complicated relationships can be.\",\"starring\":\"Hugh Grant, Alan Rickman, Emma Thompson\",\"directedBy\":\"Richard Curtis\",\"producedBy\":\"Tim Bevan, Eric Fellner, Duncan Kenworthy\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":135,\"genre\":\"Comedy\",\"allGenres\":\"Comedy, Romance, Drama\",\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"H9Z3_ifFheQ\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2003-09-07\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-02\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":7.3525,\"tmdbId\":\"508\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"18303\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Love Actually (Re: 2021) (2D) [15]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362851\",\"time\":\"2025-12-02T10:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":97,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser baby-friendly christmas\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362852\",\"time\":\"2025-12-11T20:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser christmas\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31245\",\"name\":\"The Doors: When You're Strange\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-doors-when-youre-strange\",\"posterImage\":\"l1nb47sb1jj8q7qv3hxalt7s6gpy\",\"bannerImage\":\"z6x5gn4m4nkief31j6siot04udpk\",\"synopsis\":\"The chemistry of four artists made The Doors one of America’s most influential rock bands. With rare footage shot from their formation in 1965 to Jim Morrison’s death in 1971, When You’re Strange, Tom DiCillo’s GRAMMY® Award-Winning film narrated by Johnny Depp, follows the band through their career, providing insight into the revolutionary impact of their music. On the occasion of the band's 60th anniversary, the film will be presented in cinemas in 4K for the first time ever, and feature a newly recorded performance of \\\"Riders on the Storm\\\" featuring John Densmore, Robby Krieger, and special guests performing the song in exotic locations around the world in partnership with Playing For Change.\",\"starring\":\"Johnny Depp, Jim Morrison, Ray Manzarek, John Densmore, Robby Krieger\",\"directedBy\":\"Tom DiCillo\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":96,\"genre\":\"Music\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"18\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-04\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-04\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"341942\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"(DNU) Cliff Richard - The Great 80 Tour (Concert) (ANALOG) [12A]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"363327\",\"time\":\"2025-12-04T20:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":59,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"363328\",\"time\":\"2025-12-06T20:50:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31100\",\"name\":\"The Muppet Christmas Carol\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-muppet-christmas-carol\",\"posterImage\":\"yud0xyt95rk47sqtpbp6u7webdr8\",\"bannerImage\":\"oweh78j3gw9wkxteg6m3fw2khnc5\",\"synopsis\":\"'Tis the season for love, laughter, and one of the most cherished stories of all time!\\nJoin Kermit the Frog, Miss Piggy, and all the hilarious Muppets in this merry, magical version of Charles Dickens' classic tale.\\nAcademy Award® winner Michael Caine (Best Supporting Actor) gives a performance that's anything but \\\"bah, humbug!\\\" as greedy, penny-pinching Ebenezer Scrooge.\\nOne fateful Christmas Eve, Scrooge is visited by the Ghosts of Christmas Past, Present, and Future.\\nTogether with kind, humble Bob Cratchit (Kermit the Frog) and his family, the Spirits open Scrooge's eyes -- and his heart -- to the true meaning of Christmas\",\"starring\":\"Michael Caine, Dave Goelz, Steve Whitmire\",\"directedBy\":\"Brian Henson\",\"producedBy\":\"Brian Henson, Martin G. Baker\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":86,\"genre\":\"Music\",\"allGenres\":\"Music, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Drama\",\"rating\":\"U\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"pNo-Q0IDJi0\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"1992-12-10\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-06\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":2.2572,\"tmdbId\":\"10437\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"8888329\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Muppets Christmas Carol, The (2D) [U]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362872\",\"time\":\"2025-12-06T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":58,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser kids-club christmas\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362873\",\"time\":\"2025-12-24T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser christmas\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31099\",\"name\":\"How The Grinch Stole Christmas\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"how-the-grinch-stole-christmas\",\"posterImage\":\"gmm2lq9t0z68nrycp926ejm7tcvc\",\"bannerImage\":\"xrjbt0ji7iaaz845wmp8u4h33pxm\",\"synopsis\":\"Inside a snowflake exists the magical land of Whoville. In Whoville, live the Whos, an almost mutated sort of Munchkin-like people. All the Whos love Christmas, yet just outside of their beloved Whoville lives the Grinch. The Grinch is a nasty creature that hates Christmas, and plots to steal it away from the Whos, whom he equally abhors. Yet a small child, Cindy Lou Who, decides to try befriending the Grinch.\",\"starring\":\"Jim Carrey, Taylor Momsen, Jeffrey Tambor\",\"directedBy\":\"Ron Howard\",\"producedBy\":\"Ron Howard, Brian Grazer\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":104,\"genre\":\"Family\",\"allGenres\":\"Family, Comedy, Fantasy\",\"rating\":\"PG\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"Icl7XRLjCUo\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2000-11-15\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-07\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":12.9397,\"tmdbId\":\"8871\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"12218\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Grinch (Re: 2021), The (2D) [U]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362871\",\"time\":\"2025-12-07T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"443\",\"seatsRemaining\":16,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser kids-club christmas\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31215\",\"name\":\"Eyes Wide Shut\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"eyes-wide-shut\",\"posterImage\":\"ktp28ep7fa6dtxxprj0r5s8j873x\",\"bannerImage\":\"nk9bfmtipz2jlx1n8834tjzur3pv\",\"synopsis\":\"After his wife, Alice, tells him about her sexual fantasies, William Harford sets out for a night of sexual adventure. After several less than successful encounters, he meets an old friend, Nick Nightingale – now a musician – who tells him of strange sex parties when he is required to play the piano blindfolded. All the men at the party are costumed and wear masks while the women are all young and beautiful. Harford manages to find an appropriate costume and heads out to the party. Once there, however, he is warned by someone who recognizes him, despite the mask, that he is in great danger. He manages to extricate himself but the threats prove to be quite real and sinister.\",\"starring\":\"Tom Cruise, Nicole Kidman, Todd Field, Sydney Pollack, Madison Eginton, Jackie Sawiris, Leslie Lowe, Peter Benson\",\"directedBy\":\"Stanley Kubrick\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":159,\"genre\":\"Thriller\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"18\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xgVo96JaqeM\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-07\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-07\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"183846\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Eyes Wide Shut (20Th Anniversary) + Never Just A Dream: Stanley Kubrick And Eyes Wide Shut (2D) [18]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362964\",\"time\":\"2025-12-07T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser christmas\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362965\",\"time\":\"2025-12-08T20:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser christmas\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31091\",\"name\":\"It's A Wonderful Life\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"its-a-wonderful-life\",\"posterImage\":\"fmsqzudqwbrna1pmf99772dvhrp0\",\"bannerImage\":\"209gvfzhxxctgq85xzgqvheqxub2\",\"synopsis\":\"Beset with personal and professional problems, George Bailey finds his previously happy life falling apart around him on Christmas Eve.\\nSeeing no way out, George considers suicide from the edge of a bridge - but Clarence, his guardian angel, intervenes and shows George what his beloved hometown of Bedford Falls would be like without him.\\nShocked by what he sees and at the unforeseen circumstances of his absence, George reconsiders and begs Clarence to return him to the problems of the present and the loving community he has fostered throughout his life\",\"starring\":\"James Stewart, Donna Reed, Lionel Barrymore\",\"directedBy\":\"Frank Capra\",\"producedBy\":\"Frank Capra\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":130,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":\"Drama, Family, Fantasy\",\"rating\":\"U\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"iLR3gZrU2Xo\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"1946-12-20\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-08\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":47.1194,\"tmdbId\":\"1585\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"992238\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"It's A Wonderful Life (Re: 1947) (2D) [U]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362856\",\"time\":\"2025-12-08T17:10:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser christmas\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362857\",\"time\":\"2025-12-15T14:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser christmas\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362858\",\"time\":\"2025-12-17T14:50:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser christmas\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362859\",\"time\":\"2025-12-24T12:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"443\",\"seatsRemaining\":16,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser christmas\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31214\",\"name\":\"Bring Your Own Baby Comedy Club\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"bring-your-own-baby-comedy-club\",\"posterImage\":\"hjhgts1l8870cv04to1o8rgfhqpb\",\"bannerImage\":\"9ywkwzecy92jnf8xfr7xhpsqwtue\",\"synopsis\":\"WINNER: Best bring-along Baby Event (HOOP Awards)\\nWINNER: Comedy Club of the Year 2024 (Innovation and Excellence Awards)\\nWINNER: Best Mental Health Boost for New Parents 2022 (UK Enterprise Awards)\\nWINNER: Best Comedy Event for Families 2023 (Prestige Awards)\\nNOMINATED: Feed With Confidence Award 2018\\n\\n“Yaaaas! This is the maternity leave I have dreamed of!” – Michelle, BYOB Guest\\n\\n“Bring Your Own Baby Comedy has transformed parental leave” – i paper\\n\\u2028\\nJoin us for an afternoon of hilarious comedy, where you can relax and have a good laugh at the best comedians in the UK, without needing childcare! There’s buggy parking, baby changing so that you can take some time for yourself and just be entertained. The bar is fully stocked, whether you fancy a cuppa or even something a bit stronger (G\\u0026T anyone?). If you need to whip out a bum (the baby’s please!), a boob or a bottle, then please feel free… and our comics won’t mind being heckled by our younger guests!*\\n\\nEach show features two brilliant comedians plus a compere, and the whole show will last approx. 75 minutes including an interval.\\n\\n*Please note that we have a 15-month age limit for our little laughers, as our comedians will be performing their usual grown-up jokes!\\n\\n*Please note that buggies cannot be brought into the performance space with you so please bring a sling if your baby would like to relax during the show\\n* If you are coming with twins or have any additional needs, please contact our friendly team at info@byobcomedy.com\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":120,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"18\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-09\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-09\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"54811\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Alfie Boe - The 'Bring Him Home' Tour (Concert) (2D) [12A]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"420\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362962\",\"time\":\"2025-12-09T11:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":21,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":104,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362963\",\"time\":\"2026-02-10T11:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":123,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31111\",\"name\":\"Mrs Harris Goes To Paris\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"mrs-harris-goes-to-paris\",\"posterImage\":\"pshxet2g7bmwga5ze3y6uhpzimgg\",\"bannerImage\":\"v6srw90i49bqazs3hgc4xe3dr9fh\",\"synopsis\":\"A new adaptation of Paul Gallico's much-loved novel about a cleaning lady in 1950s London who falls in love with an haute couture dress by Christian Dior and decides to gamble everything for the sake of this folly.\",\"starring\":\"Lesley Manville, Isabelle Huppert, Lambert Wilson\",\"directedBy\":\"Anthony Fabian\",\"producedBy\":\"Anthony Fabian, Xavier Marchand, Guillaume Benski\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":116,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":\"Drama\",\"rating\":\"PG\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"h1tIdv5avWY\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2022-09-30\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-10\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":3.1038,\"tmdbId\":\"754609\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"338412\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Mrs. Harris Goes To Paris (2D) [PG]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362878\",\"time\":\"2025-12-10T20:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":59,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser knitflicks\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29174\",\"name\":\"The Royal Ballet: The Nutcracker\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-royal-ballet-the-nutcracker\",\"posterImage\":\"b699pmy1kk5peh8api6oqn2xvbco\",\"bannerImage\":\"uet6gmb2sxo26jlo1k6nmgzfwix4\",\"synopsis\":\"The magician Herr Drosselmeyer needs to save his nephew. Hans-Peter has been transformed into a Nutcracker; the only way to save him is for the Nutcracker to defeat the Mouse King and find a girl to love and care for him. A flicker of hope comes in the form of the young Clara, whom Drosselmeyer meets at a Christmas party. With some magic, a cosy Christmas gathering turns into a marvellous adventure.\\nPeter Wright’s The Nutcracker has enchanted audiences since its 1984 premiere by the Company.\\nFeaturing Tchaikovsky’s most familiar melodies and brought to life by Julia Trevelyan Oman’s exquisite designs, The Nutcracker is sure to be a festive firecracker for all ages.\\n\\nRuntime TBC\",\"starring\":\"Lauren Cuthbertson, Gary Avis, Francesca Hayward\",\"directedBy\":\"\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":130,\"genre\":\"Family\",\"allGenres\":\"Family\",\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"-gpHw-cXgik\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-10\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-10\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":2.5298,\"tmdbId\":\"427300\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"466185\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"NUTCRACKER - ROH, LONDON 2025 (BALLET), THE [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362951\",\"time\":\"2025-12-10T19:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":23,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":78,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362952\",\"time\":\"2025-12-15T12:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":8,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":93,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29163\",\"name\":\"The Metropolitan Opera: Andrea Chénier\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-metropolitan-opera-andrea-chnier\",\"posterImage\":\"aoj961nuuqep3jxdr4v24pwhix74\",\"bannerImage\":\"e7wg5777vb0p3o2bcd2l164rcpc6\",\"synopsis\":\"Giordano’s passionate tragedy stars tenor Piotr Beczała as the virtuous poet who falls victim to the intrigue and violence of the French Revolution. Following their celebrated recent partnership in Giordano’s Fedora in the 2022–23 Live in HD season, Beczała reunites with soprano Sonya Yoncheva as Chénier’s aristocratic lover, Maddalena di Coigny, with baritone Igor Golovatenko as Carlo Gérard, the agent of the Reign of Terror who seals their fates.\\nMet Principal Guest Conductor Daniele Rustioni takes the podium to lead Nicolas Joël’s gripping staging, which will be transmitted live from the Met stage to\\ncinemas on December 13.\",\"starring\":\"\",\"directedBy\":\"Daniele Rustioni\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":211,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"lU0w-kpa_Wo\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-13\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-13\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":0.2098,\"tmdbId\":\"1479647\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"465750\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"ANDREA CHENIERÂ - MET OPERA 2025 (OPERA) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362936\",\"time\":\"2025-12-13T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":25,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":76,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362937\",\"time\":\"2025-12-16T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":11,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":90,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31254\",\"name\":\"Ghost Trail\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"ghost-trail\",\"posterImage\":\"33vpu5jwq0lx355nnjhybfdtzusw\",\"bannerImage\":\"olstyvhmlssqgznpiv736p2i7ivy\",\"synopsis\":\"Ghost Trail (Les Fantômes) opened the Cannes 2024 Semaine de la Critique and later won the Best Debut Prix Louis-Delluc for the director Jonathan Millet, who made many documentaries previously.\\n\\nHaving survived a spell in Syria’s notorious Sednaya prison, Hamid (Adam Bessa) is now part of a secret group pursuing fugitive war criminals from Assad’s regime. His mission takes him to Strasbourg, on the trail of his former torturer whom he must confront.\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":\"Jonathan Millet\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":105,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ND_tjVYxLgE\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-13\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-13\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"416175\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"GHOST TRAIL [15]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"363335\",\"time\":\"2025-12-13T11:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser intro french-impressions\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"363336\",\"time\":\"2025-12-13T11:25:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":125,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser intro french-impressions\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"363337\",\"time\":\"2025-12-13T11:25:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":125,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser intro french-impressions\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31160\",\"name\":\"The Marbles\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-marbles\",\"posterImage\":\"49o0m607gn5u5lr4d08c16r3ne1o\",\"bannerImage\":\"sshuyyuu1hur3tv36eco107vjyyn\",\"synopsis\":\"David Wilkinson joins Torin Douglas for a Q\\u0026A after the film.\\n\\nTHE MARBLES is a compelling new documentary examining one of history's most controversial cultural disputes—the removal of the Parthenon Marbles—and the ongoing campaign to return them to Greece. From imperial acquisition to modern-day advocacy, this is the story of heritage, identity, and justice.\\n\\nIn 1801, Lord Elgin controversially removed half the Parthenon's sculptures, sparking a backlash from his contemporaries that continues today. What followed was a 200-year diplomatic battle between Greece and Britain over cultural patrimony. When respected actress and politician Melina Mercouri challenged the British Museum in 1983, she transformed the issue into an international cause that redefined how we think about cultural ownership.\\n\\nThis thoughtful documentary, filmed over five years starting on the 200th anniversary of Greek independence, reveals the complexities of museum ethics, cultural policy, and the competing claims surrounding ancient artefacts. From Athens to London, it’s a tale of empire, resistance, and redemption—with Scotland emerging as an unlikely hero.\\n\\nThe debate continues to evolve, raising fundamental questions about the rightful ownership of ancient treasures. The question isn't just about marble sculptures—it's about how we value and preserve cultural heritage in a post-colonial world.\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":\"David Wilkinson\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":113,\"genre\":\"Documentary\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"12A\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PO4qNR8LAHI\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-14\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-14\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"341942\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"(DNU) Cliff Richard - The Great 80 Tour (Concert) (ANALOG) [12A]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"420\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362740\",\"time\":\"2025-12-14T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser qa\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31095\",\"name\":\"Home Alone\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"home-alone\",\"posterImage\":\"5t7obgppat83paeunblh4hzgs665\",\"bannerImage\":\"6et28wsbyjbwulz8f0w6qzpy2h3u\",\"synopsis\":\"All Kevin McCallister wants for Christmas is for his family to disappear.\\nSo when he wakes to discover that they have accidentally left for their Christmas trip without him and that his wish has come true, he does what any kid would do - he parties!\\nBut when he learns that two burglars with a Christmas list of their own are working their way up the block, he is forced to defend the family home on his own and sets about decking the halls with ingenious traps to hold the thieves at bay until his relatives come home.\",\"starring\":\"Macaulay Culkin, Joe Pesci, Daniel Stern\",\"directedBy\":\"Chris Columbus\",\"producedBy\":\"John Hughes\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":103,\"genre\":\"Comedy\",\"allGenres\":\"Comedy, Family\",\"rating\":\"PG\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"jEDaVHmw7r4\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"1990-11-16\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-14\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":1.0952,\"tmdbId\":\"771\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"258967\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Home Alone (Re: 1990) (2D) [PG]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362868\",\"time\":\"2025-12-14T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser kids-club christmas\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362870\",\"time\":\"2025-12-26T15:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser christmas\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31089\",\"name\":\"The Holiday\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-holiday\",\"posterImage\":\"kz2li385be04p3comey8gp1tm56v\",\"bannerImage\":\"p0e3r1lwmw9shcuitga2wlc7v2cu\",\"synopsis\":\"Two women, one from the United States and one from the United Kingdom, swap homes at Christmastime after bad breakups with their boyfriends. Each woman finds romance with a local man but realizes that the imminent return home may end the relationship.\",\"starring\":\"Cameron Diaz, Kate Winslet, Jude Law\",\"directedBy\":\"Nancy Meyers\",\"producedBy\":\"Nancy Meyers, Bruce A. Block\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":136,\"genre\":\"Comedy\",\"allGenres\":\"Comedy, Romance\",\"rating\":\"12A\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"BDi5zH18vxU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2006-12-08\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-16\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":9.2362,\"tmdbId\":\"1581\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"25328\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Holiday, The (2D) [12A]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362853\",\"time\":\"2025-12-16T10:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"baby-friendly\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362854\",\"time\":\"2025-12-18T20:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser christmas\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31218\",\"name\":\"Little Women\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"little-women\",\"posterImage\":\"wamtadwbt2ucc3c4xckdiqta64ui\",\"bannerImage\":\"dmkatfpfajc8j4xuy8awjb3rbqai\",\"synopsis\":\"In 19th century Massachusetts, the March sisters—Meg, Jo, Beth, and Amy—on the threshold of womanhood, go through many ups and downs in life and endeavour to make important decisions about their futures. (taken from IMDB)\\n\\nJoin us by first reading Louisa May Alcott’s classic novel Little Women, and then attending the screening of Greta Gerwig’s adaptation on 17th December. Afterwards there will be a guided discussion, followed by the opportunity to mingle with your fellow biblio- and cinephiles.\",\"starring\":\"Florence Pugh, Timothée Chalamet, Saoirse Ronan, Emma Watson, Meryl Streep, Laura Dern, James Norton, Eliza Scanlen, Bob Odenkirk, Chris Cooper, Tracy Letts, Louis Garrel, Jayne Houdyshellx\",\"directedBy\":\"Greta Gerwig\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":135,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"U\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AST2-4db4ic\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-17\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-17\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"928652\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Little Women (1995) (2D) [U]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362967\",\"time\":\"2025-12-17T19:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":97,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser ad-free books-on-film christmas\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31093\",\"name\":\"Wonka\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"wonka\",\"posterImage\":\"qnam26fcbbmctoxx1jy3kxyfc907\",\"bannerImage\":\"6sapyz1hfq6ek54au2sm71903pmw\",\"synopsis\":\"Based on the extraordinary character at the center of Charlie and the Chocolate Factory, Roald Dahl’s most iconic children’s book and one of the best-selling children’s books of all time, “Wonka” tells the wondrous story of how the world’s greatest inventor, magician and chocolate-maker became the beloved Willy Wonka we know today.\\n\\nFrom Paul King, writer/director of the “Paddington” films, David Heyman, producer of “Harry Potter,” “Gravity,” “Fantastic Beasts” and “Paddington,” and producers Alexandra Derbyshire (the “Paddington” films, “Jurassic World: Dominion”) and Luke Kelly (“Roald Dahl’s The Witches”), comes an intoxicating mix of magic and music, mayhem and emotion, all told with fabulous heart and humor. Starring Timothée Chalamet in the title role, this irresistibly vivid and inventive big screen spectacle will introduce audiences to a young Willy Wonka, chock-full of ideas and determined to change the world one delectable bite at a time—proving that the best things in life begin with a dream, and if you’re lucky enough to meet Willy Wonka, anything is possible.\",\"starring\":\"Timothée Chalamet, Calah Lane, Keegan-Michael Key\",\"directedBy\":\"Paul King\",\"producedBy\":\"David Heyman, Alexandra Derbyshire, Luke Kelly\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":116,\"genre\":\"Adventure\",\"allGenres\":\"Adventure, Comedy, Family\",\"rating\":\"PG\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"qhzNQ9vaJqE\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2023-12-08\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-20\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":9.3762,\"tmdbId\":\"787699\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"332477\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Wonka (2D) [PG]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362862\",\"time\":\"2025-12-20T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser kids-club christmas\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362863\",\"time\":\"2025-12-21T10:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":121,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser dog-friendly christmas\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31090\",\"name\":\"Die Hard\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"die-hard\",\"posterImage\":\"glpw19wsms4iaqhwzq8ddkci7pcb\",\"bannerImage\":\"txlhhlq3jk9tidm8qb0dj0kzkjdz\",\"synopsis\":\"On Christmas Eve, tough New York detective John McClane arrives in Los Angeles with the aim of reconciling with his estranged wife, Holly at the Christmas party of her employer, the Nakatomi Corporation. When the party is disrupted by a group of heavily armed criminals led by the charismatic Hans Gruber, McClane evades capture and begins a one-man war against the hostage takers who are attempting to rob the corporation whilst occupying the LAPD and the FBI by posing as terrorists. Outmanned, outgunned and ill-equipped for the task at hand, McClane calls in the help of a local beat cop in his crusade against Gruber.\",\"starring\":\"Bruce Willis, Alan Rickman, Alexander Godunov\",\"directedBy\":\"John McTiernan\",\"producedBy\":\"Lawrence Gordon, Joel Silver, Beau Marks\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":131,\"genre\":\"Action\",\"allGenres\":\"Action, Thriller\",\"rating\":\"18\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"gYWvwkXreaI\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"1988-07-15\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-21\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":9.2549,\"tmdbId\":\"562\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"992043\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Die Hard (2D) [12A]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362855\",\"time\":\"2025-12-21T17:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser christmas\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362847\",\"time\":\"2025-12-23T20:40:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser christmas\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31098\",\"name\":\"Home Alone 2: Lost in New York\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"home-alone-2-lost-in-new-york-2\",\"posterImage\":\"2mjxb9l099e9vte0ur8v7b0ccbvt\",\"bannerImage\":\"6ppi44e2tixwbnazdqhd1f51jhwn\",\"synopsis\":\"Instead of flying to Florida with his folks, Kevin ends up alone in New York, where he gets a hotel room with his dad's credit card—despite problems from a clerk and meddling bellboy. But when Kevin runs into his old nemeses, the Wet Bandits, he's determined to foil their plans to rob a toy store on Christmas eve.\",\"starring\":\"Macaulay Culkin, Joe Pesci, Daniel Stern\",\"directedBy\":\"Chris Columbus\",\"producedBy\":\"John Hughes\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":120,\"genre\":\"Comedy\",\"allGenres\":\"Comedy, Family, Adventure\",\"rating\":\"PG\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"1992-11-19\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-21\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":13.5922,\"tmdbId\":\"772\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"2319\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Home Alone 2: Lost In New York (2D) [PG]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362867\",\"time\":\"2025-12-21T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"443\",\"seatsRemaining\":16,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser kids-club christmas\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362869\",\"time\":\"2025-12-24T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser christmas\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31086\",\"name\":\"The Holdovers\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-holdovers\",\"posterImage\":\"r4v1ubhrorwgoh9v462lhxxz5k9f\",\"bannerImage\":\"yod3kraoktddzdgwl34qgjh25lwt\",\"synopsis\":\"From acclaimed director Alexander Payne, The Holdovers follows a curmudgeonly instructor (Paul Giamatti) at a New England prep school who is forced to remain on campus during Christmas break to babysit the handful of students with nowhere to go. Eventually he forms an unlikely bond with one of them -- a damaged, brainy troublemaker (newcomer Dominic Sessa) -- and with the school’s head cook, who has just lost a son in Vietnam (Da’Vine Joy Randolph).\",\"starring\":\"Paul Giamatti, Dominic Sessa, Da'Vine Joy Randolph\",\"directedBy\":\"Alexander Payne\",\"producedBy\":\"Mark Johnson, Bill Block, David Hemingson\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":133,\"genre\":\"Comedy\",\"allGenres\":\"Comedy, Drama\",\"rating\":\"155\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"bAXd27wVpIc\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2024-01-19\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-23\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":4.1334,\"tmdbId\":\"840430\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"383905\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Holdovers, The (2D) [15]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362846\",\"time\":\"2025-12-23T17:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser christmas\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362849\",\"time\":\"2025-12-28T17:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":58,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser christmas\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362850\",\"time\":\"2025-12-29T20:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser christmas\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31248\",\"name\":\"The Marching Band\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-marching-band\",\"posterImage\":\"42z07bw48h89c0sp4d943qgioxy9\",\"bannerImage\":\"guomsqmk4zybwqjapjkmbtsao4rx\",\"synopsis\":\"French Film expert Jon Davies hosts an informative and entertaining pre-film lecture before a hand-picked French film release in our new monthly club. The introduction lasts around sixty minutes, followed by a short break for refreshments followed by the film screening. French Impressions joins us from the Waterman’s Arts Centre, where Jon hosted it for over twenty years, with their kind consent.\\n\\nAbout the film:\\nAcclaimed conductor Thibaut has leukemia and needs a bone marrow donor. Learning he was adopted, he finds an older brother, a musician and factory worker. Their reunion sparks a fraternal, musical journey amidst the town's factory closure.\",\"starring\":\"Benjamin Lavernhe, Pierre Lottin, Sarah Suco, Clémence Massart-Weit, Ludmila Mikaël\",\"directedBy\":\"Emmanuel Courcol\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":102,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bhfCXPYIKs8\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-10\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-01-10\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"341942\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"(DNU) Cliff Richard - The Great 80 Tour (Concert) (ANALOG) [12A]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"363330\",\"time\":\"2026-01-10T11:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser intro french-impressions\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29175\",\"name\":\"The Metropolitan Opera: I Puritani\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-metropolitan-opera-i-puritani\",\"posterImage\":\"fo0522ngoutarrs6ro22wo9v25z5\",\"bannerImage\":\"5oy7d9tje40lvbp3ep7ve525sqp4\",\"synopsis\":\"For gorgeous melody, spellbinding coloratura, and virtuoso vocal fireworks, I Puritani has few equals.\\nOn January 10, the first new Met production of Bellini’s final masterpiece in nearly 50 years—a strikin staging by Charles Edwards, who makes his company directorial debut after many successes as a set designer—arrives in cinemas worldwide. The Met has assembled a world-beating quartet of stars, conducted by Marco Armiliato, for the demanding principal roles. Soprano Lisette Oropesa and tenor Lawrence Brownlee are Elvira and Arturo, brought together by love and torn apart by the political rifts of the English Civil War, with baritone Artur Ruciński as Riccardo, betrothed to Elvira against her will, and bass-baritone Christian Van Horn as Elvira’s sympathetic uncle, Giorgio.\",\"starring\":\"\",\"directedBy\":\"Marco Armiliato\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":225,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"lU0w-kpa_Wo\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-10\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-01-10\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":1.8221,\"tmdbId\":\"1479648\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"465754\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"I PURITANIÂ - MET OPERA 2026 (OPERA) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362953\",\"time\":\"2026-01-10T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":13,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":88,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362954\",\"time\":\"2026-01-12T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":97,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31092\",\"name\":\"Inside Out 2\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"inside-out-2\",\"posterImage\":\"4v2uoc4vj3uqeey7g0e2mj53252e\",\"bannerImage\":\"0disupeno6zfut6hvy485m8jmehv\",\"synopsis\":\"Disney and Pixar’s “Inside Out 2” returns to the mind of newly minted teenager Riley just as headquarters is undergoing a sudden demolition to make room for something entirely unexpected: new Emotions! Joy, Sadness, Anger, Fear and Disgust, who’ve long been running a successful operation by all accounts, aren’t sure how to feel when Anxiety shows up. And it looks like she’s not alone.\",\"starring\":\"Amy Poehler, Maya Hawke, Kensington Tallman\",\"directedBy\":\"Kelsey Mann\",\"producedBy\":\"Mark Nielsen\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":96,\"genre\":\"Animation\",\"allGenres\":\"Animation, Family\",\"rating\":\"U\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"LEjhY15eCx0\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2024-06-14\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-01-10\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":25.2317,\"tmdbId\":\"1022789\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"345981\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Inside Out 2 (2D) (2D) [U]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362860\",\"time\":\"2026-01-10T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser kids-club\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362861\",\"time\":\"2026-01-11T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser kids-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29168\",\"name\":\"The Royal Opera: La Traviata\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-royal-opera-la-traviata\",\"posterImage\":\"nc97pyskf4zlx33gbond3bqpqqmf\",\"bannerImage\":\"yrg1x69kou02y8ucyalk3sccfbxg\",\"synopsis\":\"At one of her lavish parties, celebrated Parisan courtesan Violetta is introduced to Alfredo Germont.\\nThe two fall madly in love, and though hesitant to leave behind her life of luxury and freedom, Violetta follows her heart.\\nBut the young couple’s happiness is short-lived, as the harsh realities of life soon come knocking.\\nAs intimate as it is sumptuous, La traviata features some of opera’s most famous melodies, and is a star vehicle for its leading soprano role sung by Ermonela Jaho. In director Richard Eyre’s world of seductive grandeur, the tender and devastating beauty at the centre of Verdi’s opera shines bright.\",\"starring\":\"Ermonela Jaho, Giovanni Sala, Aleksey Isaev\",\"directedBy\":\"Richard Eyre\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":240,\"genre\":\"Family\",\"allGenres\":\"Family\",\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"9B8DfHdFhvM\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-14\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-01-14\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":0.3066,\"tmdbId\":\"1483682\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"466187\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"LA TRAVIATA - ROH, LONDON 2026 (OPERA) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362942\",\"time\":\"2026-01-14T18:50:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":9,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":92,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362943\",\"time\":\"2026-01-20T12:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":7,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":94,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29172\",\"name\":\"The Royal Ballet: Woolf Works\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-royal-ballet-woolf-works\",\"posterImage\":\"885znt6ob86bwnwi5sxrys02dc4q\",\"bannerImage\":\"m1z48j07nwnompp2d8e4f72c2qfj\",\"synopsis\":\"Virginia Woolf defied literary conventions to depict rich inner worlds – her heightened, startling and poignant reality.\\nResident Choreographer Wayne McGregor leads a luminous artistic team to evoke Woolf’s signature stream of consciousness writing style in this immense work that rejects traditional narrative structures.\\nWoolf Works is a collage of themes from Mrs Dalloway, Orlando, The Waves and Woolf’s other writings.\\nCreated in 2015 for The Royal Ballet, this Olivier-award winning ballet triptych captures the heart of Woolf’s uniquely artistic spirit.\\n\\nRuntime TBC\",\"starring\":\"\",\"directedBy\":\"\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":210,\"genre\":\"Family\",\"allGenres\":\"Family\",\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"OdEztPc-wuM\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-02-09\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-02-09\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":0.0982,\"tmdbId\":\"1483685\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"466188\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"WOOLF WORKS - ROH, LONDON 2026 (BALLET) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362946\",\"time\":\"2026-02-09T19:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":11,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":90,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362947\",\"time\":\"2026-02-16T12:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":100,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29173\",\"name\":\"The Royal Ballet: Giselle\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-royal-ballet-giselle\",\"posterImage\":\"p60qqaju2dj41h068zdhj78wnmwl\",\"bannerImage\":\"mcvwy1etpaz5hr0es117vsvgq2bk\",\"synopsis\":\"The peasant girl Giselle has fallen in love with Albrecht.\\nWhen she discovers that he is actually a nobleman promised to another, she kills herself in despair. Her spirit joins the Wilis: the vengeful ghosts of women hell-bent on killing any man who crosses their path in a dance to the death.\\nWracked with guilt, Albrecht visits Giselle’s grave, where he must face the Wilis – and Giselle’s ghost.\\nPeter Wright’s 1985 production of this quintessential Romantic ballet is a classic of The Royal Ballet repertory.\\nSet to Adolphe Adam’s evocative score and with atmospheric designs by John Macfarlane,\\nGiselle conjures up the earthly and otherworldly realms in a tale of love, betrayal and redemption.\\n\\nRuntime TBC\",\"starring\":\"\",\"directedBy\":\"\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":210,\"genre\":\"Family\",\"allGenres\":\"Family\",\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"7T_A4S3PWnE\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-03\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-03-03\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":0.0071,\"tmdbId\":\"1385864\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"466189\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"GISELLE - ROH, LONDON 2026 (BALLET) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362949\",\"time\":\"2026-03-03T19:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":12,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":89,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362950\",\"time\":\"2026-03-09T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":99,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29179\",\"name\":\"Exhibition On Screen: Turner \\u0026 Constable\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"exhibition-on-screen-turner-constable\",\"posterImage\":\"gvuegqj574ym3nh8of9p9yl4c8d2\",\"bannerImage\":\"soio8yatn4pvwdj0bu5dv95e9eed\",\"synopsis\":\"Two of Britain’s greatest painters, J.M.W. Turner and John Constable were also the greatest of rivals.\\nBorn within a year of each other, both used landscape painting to reflect the changing world around them.\\nTate Britain is bringing these two greats together for a groundbreaking exhibition, in London from November 2025 to April 2026, and Exhibition on Screen once again has exclusive and privileged access to bring their extraordinary art and remarkable stories to the big screen in March 2026 so that both can be enjoyed together.\\nDon’t miss this opportunity to see these greats side-by-side, as they so often were in life, on the big screen for the first time.\\nTurner’s blazing sunsets and sublime scenes from his travels and Constable’s idealised depictions of beloved places from home whipped the public of the time into a frenzy of enthusiasm.\\nCritics compared their starkly different styles to a clash of ‘fire and water’.\\nMarking 250 years since their births, this unmissable new documentary explores Turner and Constable’s intertwined lives and legacies alongside the groundbreaking Tate exhibition.\\nDiscover unexpected sides to both artists with intimate views of sketchbooks and personal items and insights from leading experts. This is not to be missed.\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":\"David Bickerstaff\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":90,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"sWjex7kfdAg\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-10\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-03-10\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"470745\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"EXHIBITION ON SCREEN: TURNER \\u0026amp; CONSTABLE 2026 (EXHIBITION) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362960\",\"time\":\"2026-03-10T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":7,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":94,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362961\",\"time\":\"2026-03-17T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":100,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29167\",\"name\":\"Dawn of Impressionism: Paris, 1874\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"dawn-of-impressionism-paris-1874\",\"posterImage\":\"gcfa2lhssgduxqmlvh1uvq5sdjlr\",\"bannerImage\":\"jgx682akdussc3zncq9ovep2nm9u\",\"synopsis\":\"The Impressionists are the most popular group in art history - millions flock every year to marvel at their masterpieces. But, to begin with, they were scorned, penniless outsiders.\\n1874 was the year that changed everything; the first Impressionists, “hungry for independence”, broke the mould by holding their own exhibition outside official channels. Impressionism was born and the art world was changed forever.\\nWhat led to that first groundbreaking show 150 years ago? Who were the maverick personalities that wielded their brushes in such a radical and provocative way?\\nThe spectacular Musée d’Orsay exhibition brings fresh eyes to this extraordinary tale of passion and rebellion. The story is told not by historians and curators but in the words of those who witnessed the dawn of Impressionism: the artists, press and people of Paris, 1874.\\nMade in close collaboration with the Musee d’Orsay and National Gallery of Art, Washington D.C.\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":\"Ali Ray\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":92,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"PG\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"ahXVMZenea0\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-03-18\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-03-18\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"422140\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Exhibition On Screen: Dawn Of Impressionism, Paris 1874 2025 (Exhibition) (2D) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362941\",\"time\":\"2026-03-18T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":16,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":44,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29177\",\"name\":\"The Metropolitan Opera: Tristan Und Isolde\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-metropolitan-opera-tristan-und-isolde\",\"posterImage\":\"540mvout7rx71uwtw6hfw25c1jlx\",\"bannerImage\":\"1e9jmpc4endio7das8w6xels9bs1\",\"synopsis\":\"After years of anticipation, a truly unmissable event arrives in cinemas worldwide on March 21 as the electrifying Lise Davidsen tackles one of the ultimate roles for dramatic soprano: the Irish princess Isolde in Wagner’s transcendent meditation on love and death. Heroic tenor Michael Spyres stars opposite\\nDavidsen as the love-drunk Tristan. The momentous occasion also marks the advent of a new, Met-debut staging by Yuval Sharon—hailed by The New York Times as “the most visionary opera director of his generation” and the first American to direct an opera at the famed Wagner festival in Bayreuth—as well\\nas Music Director Yannick Nézet-Séguin’s first time leading Tristan und Isolde at the Met. Mezzosoprano Ekaterina Gubanova reprises her portrayal of Brangäne, alongside bass-baritone Tomasz Konieczny, who sings Kurwenal after celebrated Met appearances in Wagner’s Der Fliegende Holländer and Ring cycle. Bass-baritone Ryan Speedo Green makes an important role debut as King Marke.\",\"starring\":\"Nina Maria Stemme, Ekaterina Gubanova, Stuart Skelton\",\"directedBy\":\"Mariusz Treliński\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":310,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":\"Drama, Music\",\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"w3Y-BNewUes\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-21\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-03-21\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":2.5473,\"tmdbId\":\"417537\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"465749\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"TRISTAN UND ISOLDEÂ - MET OPERA 2026 (OPERA) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362955\",\"time\":\"2026-03-21T16:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":15,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":86,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362956\",\"time\":\"2026-03-24T11:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":3,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":98,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29162\",\"name\":\"The Royal Opera: Siegfried\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-royal-opera-siegfried\",\"posterImage\":\"2n8z09m6o2pqch33oq5v9ki0uw7q\",\"bannerImage\":\"x6z80ibmz3nlp25k6d44t0kq6ole\",\"synopsis\":\"Raised by a scheming dwarf and unaware of his true family origins, a young man embarks on an epic journey.\\nSoon, destiny brings him face-to-face with a shattered sword, a fearsome dragon and the cursed ring it guards, and a Valkyrie forced into enchanted slumber...\\nMoments of transcendent beauty and heroic triumph sparkle in the third chapter of Wagner’s Ring cycle, brought to life under Barrie Kosky’s inspired eye following his spectacular Das Rheingold (2023) and Die Walküre (2025).\\nAndreas Schager, in his much-anticipated debut with The Royal Opera, stars as Siegfried’s titular hero, alongside Christopher Maltman’s towering Wanderer, Peter Hoare’s treacherous Mime and Elisabet Strid’s radiant Brünnhilde. Antonio Pappano conducts, drawing out the unspoken tensions and ethereal mysticism of Wagner’s dynamic score.\\n\\nRuntime TBC\",\"starring\":\"Peter Hoare, Andreas Schager, Christopher Maltman\",\"directedBy\":\"Barrie Kosky\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":330,\"genre\":\"Family\",\"allGenres\":\"Family\",\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"9B8DfHdFhvM\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-31\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-03-31\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":0.0655,\"tmdbId\":\"1483691\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"466190\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"SIEGFRIED - ROH, LONDON 2026 (OPERA) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"368329\",\"time\":\"2026-03-31T16:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":22,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":79,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362934\",\"time\":\"2026-04-06T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":100,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29164\",\"name\":\"The Royal Opera: The Magic Flute\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-royal-opera-the-magic-flute\",\"posterImage\":\"bn4lmn3gl18f70zoxxelezhhkldx\",\"bannerImage\":\"05sqp9ye1i70ewckxygu58p6gjo2\",\"synopsis\":\"Princess Pamina has been captured. Her mother, the Queen of the Night, tasks the young Prince Tamino with her daughter’s rescue. But when Tamino and his friendly sidekick, Papageno, embark on their adventure, they soon learn that when it comes to the quest for love, nothing is as it really seems.\\nGuided by a magic flute, they encounter monsters, villains, and a mysterious brotherhood of men – but help, it turns out, comes when you least expect it.\\nMozart’s fantastical opera glitters in David McVicar’s enchanting production. A star cast including Julia Bullock as Pamina, Amitai Pati as Tamino, Huw Montague Rendall as Papageno, Kathryn Lewek as the Queen of the Night, and Soloman Howard as Sarastro, led by French conductor Marie Jacquot in her Covent Garden debut.\\n\\nRuntime TBC\",\"starring\":\"Siobhan Stagg, Mauro Peter, Roderick Williams\",\"directedBy\":\"David McVicar\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":210,\"genre\":\"Family\",\"allGenres\":\"Family\",\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"7jTbrr-0aEA\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-04-21\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-04-21\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":1.0197,\"tmdbId\":\"507224\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"466191\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"MAGIC FLUTE - ROH, LONDON 2026 (OPERA), THE [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"363317\",\"time\":\"2026-04-21T17:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":11,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":90,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"368330\",\"time\":\"2026-04-27T11:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":12,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":89,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29182\",\"name\":\"The Metropolitan Opera: Eugene Onegin\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-metropolitan-opera-eugene-onegin\",\"posterImage\":\"gwwhm53zg53sf3vz4lz5mytha425\",\"bannerImage\":\"dpz0gtn39r2170a16jam7y8hfnon\",\"synopsis\":\"Following her acclaimed 2024 company debut in Puccini’s Madama Butterfly, soprano Asmik Grigorian returns to the Met as Tatiana, the lovestruck young heroine in this ardent operatic adaptation of Pushkin. Baritone Igor Golovatenko reprises his portrayal of the urbane Onegin, who realizes his affection for her all too late. The Met’s evocative production, directed by Tony Award–winner Deborah Warner, “offers a beautifully detailed reading of … Tchaikovsky’s lyrical romance” (The Telegraph).\",\"starring\":\"Anna Netrebko, Peter Mattei, Alexey Dolgov\",\"directedBy\":\"\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":245,\"genre\":\"Family\",\"allGenres\":\"Family\",\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"inSbxefaa90\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-05-02\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-05-02\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":2.4033,\"tmdbId\":\"444451\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"465753\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"EUGENE ONEGINÂ - MET OPERA 2026 (OPERA) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"368331\",\"time\":\"2026-05-02T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":9,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":92,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"363321\",\"time\":\"2026-05-05T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":3,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":98,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29171\",\"name\":\"Exhibition On Screen: Frida Kahlo\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"exhibition-on-screen-frida-kahlo\",\"posterImage\":\"p3hh6o6pd6m1r1moadj6t95eao5f\",\"bannerImage\":\"ru3irwyb1f7l1uk4cpwcvj2d1hoy\",\"synopsis\":\"Frida Kahlo is a phenomenon. She is arguably the world’s favourite female artist – beloved by young and old.\\nExhibition on Screen’s award-winning film – first released during covid to a restricted audience – is back by popular demand with an exciting new addition from the blockbuster transatlantic exhibition from Tate Britain and MFA Houston ‘Frida Kahlo: the Making of an Icon’.\\nBack in the cinemas in May 2026, one month before the Tate exhibition opens, allowing audiences to watch both the film and see the show.\\nWho was Frida Kahlo? Everyone knows her face but who was the woman behind the bright colours, the big brows and the floral crowns?\\nTake a journey through the life of a true icon, discover her art, and uncover the true story of her rebellious, passionate and turbulent life.\\nMaking use of the latest technology to deliver previously unimaginable quality, we take an in- depth look at key works throughout her career.\\nUsing letters Kahlo wrote to guide us, this definitive film reveals her deepest emotions and unlocks the secrets and symbolism contained within her art.\\nExhibition on Screen’s trademark combination of interviews with those who knew her and world experts, commentary and a detailed exploration of her art, combined with new special bonus footage from the 2026 Tate exhibition, delivers a treasure trove of colour and emotion. This personal and intimate film offers privileged access to her works, her home, her studio and highlights the source of her feverish creativity, her resilience and her unmatched lust for life, beauty and revolution.\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":\"Ali Ray\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":90,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"sWjex7kfdAg\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-05-19\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-05-19\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"273803\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Exhibition On Screen: Frida Kahlo 2020 (Exhibition) (2D) [12A]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"363316\",\"time\":\"2026-05-19T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":7,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":94,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"363315\",\"time\":\"2026-05-26T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29180\",\"name\":\"The Metropolitan Opera: El Último Sueño De Frida Y Diego\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-metropolitan-opera-el-ltimo-sueo-de-frida-y-diego\",\"posterImage\":\"yopmz4rfuxqzmgnf1rp3g9p3259o\",\"bannerImage\":\"6k5xnfb6l84sojewg57yjbemolpo\",\"synopsis\":\"On May 30, the Metropolitan Opera’s 2025–26 Live in HD season comes to a close with a live transmission of American composer Gabriela Lena Frank’s first opera, a magical-realist portrait of Mexico’s painterly power couple Frida Kahlo and Diego Rivera, with libretto by Pulitzer Prize–winning playwright Nilo Cruz. Fashioned as a reversal of the Orpheus and Euridice myth, the story depicts Frida, sung by leading mezzo-soprano Isabel Leonard, leaving the underworld on the Day of the Dead and reuniting with Diego, portrayed by baritone Carlos Álvarez. The famously feuding pair briefly relive their tumultuous love, embracing both the passion and the pain before bidding the land of the living a final farewell. Music Director Yannick Nézet-Séguin conducts the Met-premiere staging of Frank’s opera, a “confident, richly imagined score” (The New Yorker) that “bursts with color and fresh individuality” (Los Angeles Times). The vibrant new production, taking enthusiastic inspiration from Frida and Diego’s paintings, is directed and choreographed by Deborah Colker.\",\"starring\":\"\",\"directedBy\":\"Yannick Nézet-Séguin, Deborah Colker\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":170,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"lU0w-kpa_Wo\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-05-30\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-05-30\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":0.1393,\"tmdbId\":\"1479653\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"465752\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"EL ULTIMO SUENO DE FRIDA Y DIEGO - MET OPERA 2026 (OPERA) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"411\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"368332\",\"time\":\"2026-05-30T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":6,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":95,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"363319\",\"time\":\"2026-06-02T12:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]}]}}}"
          },
